# Home, the first Needs you row, its question: Why, an answer and Undo, Not needed and Undo, his
# own words in the reply box. The stand-in keeps every write from reaching hex.
launch /
shoot home
tap home-row-*
shoot question
tap ask-from-*
shoot why
tap ask-option-*
shoot answered
tap Undo
shoot undone
reveal ask-dismiss-*
tap ask-dismiss-*
shoot put-away
tap Undo
shoot put-back
type reply-field Quartz, but ask about the edge first
above-keyboard reply-field
shoot typing
